  "content": "\n\n<p>讓 Minecraft 的介面與音效符合 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a> 模組的美學風格。</p>\n<h2>模組支援</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\">模組</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Cobblemon 介面</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">&gt;= v1.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">&gt;= v0.7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">&gt;= v0.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fraised\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Raised</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">&gt;= v1.5.1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>推薦項目</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frespackopts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://vinnystalck.gitlab.io/minecraft-badges/badges/respackopts/cozy-recommends.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>⭐️：高度推薦 | 📁：資源包 | 🛠️：模組</p>\n<ul>\n<li>🛠️⭐️ <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frespackopts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Respackopts</a></strong>：允許您在遊戲內自訂資源包的各個設定。</li>\n<li>📁⭐️ <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fcobblemon-interface-modded\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon Interface: Modded</a></strong>：新增對許多模組的支援；</li>\n<li>🛠️ <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fraised\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Raised</a></strong>：移動快捷欄位置，使其不會裁切貼圖；</li>\n<li>📁 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffancy-item-renders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fancy Item Renders</a></strong>：調整物品顯示角度，讓擁有長貼圖的物品（例如劍）搭配圓角物品欄時看起來不會突兀。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Minecraft 資源包版本相容性</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fPack_format\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 資源包格式</a></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Minecraft 資源包</th>\n<th>Minecraft</th>\n<th>Cobblemon 介面</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>&lt;= 1.19.2</td>\n<td>&lt;= v0.7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>&gt;= 1.20</td>\n<td>&gt;= v0.8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>34</td>\n<td>&gt;= 1.21</td>\n<td>&gt;= v1.4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>其他：</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f934267676354834442%252f1091579923396820992\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.1.0/assets/compact/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> 於 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon 官方 Discord 伺服器</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcobblemon-interface\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fM4M5K4BDR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>",
